4. THIS IS NOT INVESTMENT ADVICE

Backtester simulates hypothetical trading over historical data. Its output
describes what a strategy would have done in the past, under modelling
assumptions that are documented and that are all, to some degree, wrong. Past
simulated performance does not predict future returns.

Nothing this software produces is investment, financial, legal or tax advice,
and it is not a recommendation to buy or sell anything. You are solely
responsible for any decision you make with it, and for any resulting loss.


